            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "During the third week of March, OSEP organised its annual oath-taking ceremony for newly elected student leaders and class representatives. The inauguration of student leaders included disseminating updated guidelines in the Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs). These guidelines outlined the representatives' roles and responsibilities in assisting their fellow students in navigating campus life."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Preceding the oath-taking ceremony were the annual student elections, during which candidates extensively campaigned to garner peer support. Through these campaigns, candidates showcased their qualifications and aspirations to represent various aspects of student life, including sports, arts and culture, and class representation."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The ceremony was a formal commitment by students to uphold their newly acquired responsibilities, as designated by OSEP. As they embarked on their journeys as leaders and student body representatives, participants pledged to fulfil their duties diligently."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "These responsibilities included creating an annual activity calendar and formulating objectives and guidelines to shape the identity and direction of their respective societies."
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "hard_break"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
